# This is the supplied FCC-Z physics request, with its original mesh and
# macroparticle count.  Mode 3 must reject it at the card gate before it creates
# output artifacts because radiation, photons and full luminosity are not yet
# resident.  The values are intentionally not reduced: early rejection keeps
# this test cheap while proving the exact requested domain is fail-closed.
$PARAMETERS:: mode3_original_fccz_rejected
{n_x=128;n_y=256;n_z=160;n_t=1;n_m=25000;
cut_x=1389005.7;cut_y=4096.62;cut_z=3.0*sigma_z.1;
